PROJECT: Aptos

# PHASE 3 — HISTORICAL INTELLIGENCE: APTOS

## 2021

### EV-001
**Date:** 2021-02  
**Event Name:** Aptos Labs Founded  
**Event Type:** Founding  
**Description:** Mo Shaikh dan Avery Ching mendirikan Aptos Labs Inc. di Delaware, AS, setelah keluar dari proyek Diem (Meta). Perusahaan bertujuan membangun Layer 1 berbasis Move.  
**Participants:** Mo Shaikh; Avery Ching; Aptos Labs Inc.  
**Location:** Palo Alto, California, USA  
**Status:** Completed  
**Immediate Result:** Terbentuknya entitas legal dan tim inti pengembangan.  
**Sources:**  
https://aptoslabs.com/about  
https://www.coindesk.com/business/2022/03/29/aptos-labs-raises-200m-series-a-led-by-a16z/  
https://www.bloomberg.com/profile/company/1687942D:US

### EV-002
**Date:** 2021-03  
**Event Name:** Seed Funding Round  
**Event Type:** Funding  
**Description:** Aptos Labs mengumpulkan dana seed round dari investor termasuk a16z crypto, Multicoin Capital, dan Dragonfly Capital untuk pengembangan awal protokol.  
**Participants:** Aptos Labs Inc.; a16z crypto; Multicoin Capital; Dragonfly Capital  
**Location:** Palo Alto, California, USA  
**Status:** Completed  
**Immediate Result:** Dana awal untuk rekrutmen tim dan R&D protokol.  
**Sources:**  
https://www.coindesk.com/business/2022/03/29/aptos-labs-raises-200m-series-a-led-by-a16z/  
https://a16zcrypto.com/posts/article/aptos-labs-series-a/  
